  designNotes: 'The user, 2026-10-16: target creature''s Attack and Health trade
    places, on either side. Its Attack becomes its Health as it is now, and its Health
    its Attack: a glass cannon becomes a wall, a wall a glass cannon, and a creature
    with no Attack is left with no Health and dies.'
  artDescription: A globe with its magnetic field lines flipping over, the N and
    S labels swapping places mid-air, a scientist staring at a compass whose needle
    spins wildly, and a flock of birds flying in confused loops.
